PIERRE COMPUTER COMPANY █
PROJECT: OMARCHY THEME

~~~

THEME: PIERRE DARK
SOURCE: GITHUB.COM/PIERRECOMPUTER/THEME
LICENSE: MIT
STATUS: ONLINE

~~~

Overview:
 - The standard dark palette.
 - Ported from the official Pierre theme for Visual Studio Code, Cursor, Zed, and Shiki.
 - Mercury chrome blob over a solid field, reflecting control room.

~~~

Usage:

 Omarchy:
  1. Super + Space > "Install > Style > Theme"
  2. Paste:

  https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-dark-theme

 Terminal:
  omarchy theme install https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-dark-theme

  Available themes:
   - Pierre Dark           https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-dark-theme
   - Pierre Dark Soft      https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-dark-soft-theme
   - Pierre Dark Vibrant   https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-dark-vibrant-theme  (Display P3)
   - Pierre Light          https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-light-theme
   - Pierre Light Soft     https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-light-soft-theme
   - Pierre Light Vibrant  https://github.com/douglasdemoura/omarchy-pierre-light-vibrant-theme  (Display P3)

~~~

